<title>USA: Clinton hints outlines of budget deal taking shape.</title>
<headline>Clinton hints outlines of budget deal taking shape.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton hinted on Thursday that the broad outlines of a U.S. balanced budget deal may be taking shape.</p>
<p>Told that Rep. John Spratt, the ranking Democrat on the House Budget Committee, had said earlier on Thursday that the &quot;big parameters&quot; of a deal were about to be settled, Clinton told reporters: &quot;Spratt's a smart man.&quot;</p>
</text>
